---
title: User Registration API Sequence Diagram (C#)
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant UserController
    participant UserService
    participant IUserRepository
    participant User
    participant UserProfile
    participant ValidationUtilities
    participant ErrorResponse
    participant UserResponse

    Client->>UserController: POST /users/register (UserRegistrationRequest)
    UserController->>ValidationUtilities: ValidateEmail/Password/Phone
    ValidationUtilities-->>UserController: Validation result
    alt Invalid input
        UserController-->>ErrorResponse: Create error response
        UserController-->>Client: 400/422 ErrorResponse
    else Valid input
        UserController->>UserService: RegisterUser(UserRegistrationRequest)
        UserService->>IUserRepository: IsEmailTaken(email)
        IUserRepository-->>UserService: bool
        alt Email exists
            UserService-->>ErrorResponse: Create error response
            UserService-->>UserController: 409 ErrorResponse
            UserController-->>Client: 409 ErrorResponse
        else Email available
            UserService->>User: Create User entity
            UserService->>User: SetPassword (hash password)
            UserService->>UserProfile: Create UserProfile
            UserService->>IUserRepository: AddUser(User)
            IUserRepository-->>UserService: Success
            UserService->>UserResponse: Create UserResponse
            UserService-->>UserController: 201 UserResponse
            UserController-->>Client: 201 UserResponse
        end
    end
